{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Operator decision (2026-08-10): description-size limits must be blocking. Calibrate them from historical ticket and verifier data, and set the threshold generously so normal thorough tickets do not over-block. Large descriptions are already causing material plan-review and completion-verifier pain. Keep the other AC-quality signals advisory unless separately decided."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1786387529017603001,"uuid":"dc8c5624-0b6d-4121-8351-b7371a92be16"}